\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Father of Jesus Christ, my Lord,
\par My Saviour, and my Head,
\par I trust in Thee, whose powerful word 
\par Hath raised Him from the dead.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Eternal life to all mankind
\par Thou hast in Jesus given;
\par And all who seek, in Him shall find
\par The happiness of heaven.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Faith in Thy power Thou seest I have,
\par For Thou this faith hast wrought;
\par Dead souls Thou callest from their grave,
\par And speakest worls from nought.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. In hope, against all human hope,
\par Self-desperate, I believe;
\par Thy quickening  word shall raise me up,
\par Thou shalt Thy Spirit give.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Faith, mighty faith, the promise sees,
\par And looks to that alone;
\par Laughs at impossibilities,
\par And cries: It shall be done!\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

